        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Rule 90\n- Concepts: cellular automata, exclusive or function\n- People: Stephen Wolfram\n- Publications: A New Kind of Science\n\nFacts:\n- Rule 90 is an abstract cellular automaton in the mathematical study of cellular automata.\n- Rule 90 is based on the exclusive or function.\n- Rule 90 has been called \"the simplest non-trivial cellular automaton.\"\n- In 2002, Stephen Wolfram released the book A New Kind of Science.\n- A New Kind of Science discusses Rule 90 extensively.\n- Stephen Wolfram is a British-American computer scientist, physicist, and businessman.",
